1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:06,890
This walkthrough shows the monthly inspection of feed pump B in the maintenance console.

2
00:00:06,890 --> 00:00:10,600
It's a fictional procedure, made for this portfolio.

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,680
Open the work order.

4
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:16,900
It lists the four checks and the expected range for each.

5
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,600
Select Record readings.

6
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:30,040
Enter each reading as you took it from the local gauge: the discharge pressure in bar, the bearing temperature, the vibration, and whether the seal leaks.

7
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,870
Then select Save readings.

8
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:35,470
Every result now shows against its range.

9
00:00:35,470 --> 00:00:39,870
All four are inside it, so the work order is ready to close.

10
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:42,200
Select Close work order.

11
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:49,070
If any reading had been outside its range, you would report it to the shift supervisor instead.

12
00:00:49,670 --> 00:00:51,210
That's the procedure.

13
00:00:51,210 --> 00:00:57,070
The written version, the step guide and the DITA output are in the same package.
